      <slug></slug>
      <title>Lua meets BSD</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>BSD devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract></abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Recently, the Lua scripting language has been included in the NetBSD&#xA;base system.  In this talk, Marc Balmer presents the main language&#xA;features and shows how the Lua engine can be embedded into C programs to&#xA;make them extensible and scriptable.&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
